==Trivia==
*False Resurrection's Japanese name, False Spell of Restoration (復活の偽呪文), may be a reference to the "[https://dragon-quest.org/wiki/Spell_of_Restoration Spell of Restoration]" (復活の呪文) password system used in the Famicom and MSX versions of ''Dragon Quest'' and ''Dragon Quest II''.

